{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nm7U9exRgn1795853361.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>屯門華運工業大廈有棚架起火，無人受傷。</p><p></p><p>網上片段見到，大廈中層單位內冒出熊熊火光，有竹棚和棚網被燒著，大量濃煙升上半空，更有火舌從高處跌落。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TM-1530.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VakpPIqDwP1795853566.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TM-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026JbZE3jxrWn1795853552.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場是屯門建發里2號，華運工業大廈。另一個角度看大片棚網被燒毀。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TM-1530_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265fMYybMehj1795853583.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.TM-1530_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DTUmgg0FJ61795853599.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>消防和警方下午約2時，接獲多人報案指大廈起火，消防到場灌救，至2時40分將火救熄，超過200人自行疏散，無人受傷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:56:18.004702+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:56:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T12:02:36.189572+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:49:43.671097+00:00","content_hash":"d306191189750d2735fcba10c7b95c7bf40b56fc99decace2290908a2f9aa3af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:56:18.004702+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}